        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana S35UxNRP-R  3-1/2 x 3-1/2 x Square Corners Non-Removable Pin Residential Steel Hinges, Pair,</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackage includes a pair of hinges (2) with matching steel flathead, Phillips Drive #9 x 3/4\" wood screws. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nFitted with a high grade, non-removable steel pin. Non-removable (NRP) hinges are typically used on out-swing exterior doors for security. \r\n</p><p>\r\n<img src=\"/specials/images/DEL-S35U-specifications.jpg\" width=\"300\" height=\"335\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana S35U Hinge Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Height: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Corners: Square</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 0.085\" (Residential)</li>\r\n<li>Standard Template Hole Pattern</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Pin: Steel</li>\r\n<li>Wood Screws: #9 x 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Material: Durable Steel</li>\r\n<li>Available Finishes: 9</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-S35U-specifications.pdf?v=1704262167\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana S35U Hinge Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWe offer 9 different finishes for this Hinge, but no matter which finish you choose, the parts will still be <b>High Quality Durable Steel.</b>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold in Pairs (2 Hinges)</b>\r\n</p>",
